From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:10:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: samsung: Describe Tensor G4 USB PHY

The stock zumapro-usb.dtsi includes zuma-usb.dtsi, whose USB PHY
uses PMU isolation offset 0x3eb0. Describe the G4 identity with the
zuma fallback so the existing driver data applies without another
match entry. Keep the specific compatible for future differences.

This describes the USB DRD wrapper, not the underlying eUSB2 PHY.
The latter has a separate G4 version change requiring its own review.
No board node, Type-C policy or charging behavior is added.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/devices/google/zumapro/+/8831630eee2ad095b85ed452944e6353940966a5/dts/zumapro-usb.dtsi#9
Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/devices/google/zuma/+/42395e8adcb880aa336f0da6bb2a19ed53929c40/dts/zuma-usb.dtsi#274
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../bindings/phy/samsung,usb3-drd-phy.yaml    | 34 +++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

